a hundred of them or so.

00:02:55.449 --> 00:02:57.050
Between today and yesterday.

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:58.451
And we get response.

00:02:58.451 --> 00:02:59.648
Let me show you.

00:02:59.648 --> 00:03:01.797
Life between two worlds.

00:03:01.797 --> 00:03:03.090
Thank you so much Evan.

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:04.811
